OL,3,GNEWSAPlea to 'protect GP services' and 
OL,4,Avisit pharmacy                         
OL,6,FNHS bosses in south-east England say   
OL,7,Fthe public can "protect" GP and        
OL,8,Femergency services over winter by      
OL,9,Fturning to pharmacies for seven common 
OL,10,Fconditions.                            
OL,12,FThe appeal is part of the national     
OL,13,FPharmacy First campaign, which urges   
OL,14,Fthe public to visit community          
OL,15,Fpharmacies instead of hospitals or GPs 
OL,16,Ffor winter-related conditions such as a
OL,17,Fsore throats.                          
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
