OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571   
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPlea to 'protect GP services' and 
OL,4,Avisit pharmacy                         
OL,6,FNHS Surrey and Sussex joint-chief      
OL,7,Fmedical officer, Dr Andy Rhodes, said  
OL,8,Fpeople could "get the right help       
OL,9,Fsooner" while protecting other         
OL,10,Fservices.                              
OL,12,F"As we head into winter, we want people
OL,13,Facross Surrey and Sussex to know what  
OL,14,Fsupport is available to them and to    
OL,15,Fchoose the service that best meets     
OL,16,Ftheir needs," he said.                 
